  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Yin Liu Gong says a yaksha octopus there is wrecking black oil extraction, and that Doctor Yin Xuan and Landlord Lei Yu were injured by that ancient desolate beast. He offers contribution points for chasing or killing it.",
      "chapters": [
        741
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yin_liu_gong",
        "char_landlord_lei_yu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As a rank six immortal zombie he stands guard outside Fang Yuan’s secret room with Landlord Lei Yu, bows when Fang Yuan emerges, and follows closely even after a curt dismissal. Blazing Heaven Demoness ordered them to monitor Fang Yuan and ensure his safety, so he resists the sudden demand to enter Earth Trench, then checks stock for earth shell snail mucus and is scolded for missing the star night mucus distinction.",
      "chapters": [
        930
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "monitoring-xing-xiang-zi",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
        "reg_earth_earth_trench"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He stays with Fang Yuan while Landlord Lei Yu reports to Blazing Heaven Demoness, and later joins the five immortal zombies sent as escort, listed among the three rank sixes. His title marks him as a healing Gu Immortal who cannot compare to Tai Bai Yun Sheng, though he has skill at healing immortal zombies.",
      "chapters": [
        931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "earth-trench-escort",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the group plans to clear yaksha octopuses before processing snail mucus, he suggests there may be a way to conceal the disturbance. Dragon Commander Ye Cha assigns him to stand guard outside in case of emergencies.",
      "chapters": [
        932
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yaksha-octopus-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dragon_commander_ye_cha"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan reappears as Xing Xiang Zi, he calls out in joy and accepts the star ice escape story.",
      "chapters": [
        938
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "xing-xiang-zi-reunion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
